", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974685_1840524873122821_3055739933188055904_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=mJq0tnaxAwAQ7kNvwFdTk8A&_nc_oc=Adp-8ARLoN9BxdzrqqVetzFS89drk3nfZ7EB_1xYbSELeo-cpETTboiIkCvDkWc4sio&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af3YplAd-0y3j72shGvI_n4MPmEKPtpQ10W5R-jbaNMe2g&oe=69DA4EF9"}, {"file_name": "5.png", "id": "3474397939524850", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974494_3474397942858183_7325370313459975246_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=n_D2GOkHTA0Q7kNvwEMvely&_nc_oc=AdrH48bcQCrECBoiLxgydgfbDNlqeJi3txe5JViJ62Pu71iJd4AOSpzf5uWz9CRqFRg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af0H-7F6pVyeH7Zysx5Ah8x-IhsPjDODH5O_ZyUn9_C6LQ&oe=69DA2D8B"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Hard Drive Logo (6).png", "id": "1060475455596738", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984476_1060475458930071_8663595066419356644_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=4zYY3mI5NlMQ7kNvwEY46Yn&_nc_oc=Adr3U7gEtGoGU8rJ1CuN-op8bW_HbWrTb2GMiei6yrYYutm7zg9h9rp7MamDtSjp3UQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af3thPLyMk5z4csblXuQwZKmfW_QMLn1dg9Lf1FpEIoUPQ&oe=69DA2C0E"}, "display_name": "Hard Drive", "keywords": [], "long_description": "# *Hard Drive* \n\nHard Drive is a fast-paced, multiplayer, competitive electro combat driving game. Players control sleek, neon-lit motorcycle looking vehicles, known as bykes, which leave behind a temporary solid trail of light as they move. Players must outmaneuver their opponents by creating a trails of light that they cannot avoid crashing into, while avoiding the trails left by other players.\n\n# _Current Features_\n- Non PvP Driving Park\n- 6 Player Combat Arena\n- Season Pass with Progression Rewards\n- Cosmetic Shop \n\n## More Coming Soon. . .", "short_description": "Electro Combat Driving "}]}, "devel